sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Firm
    participant API as Platform API
    participant Pipe as Ingestion Pipeline
    participant Eval as Evaluation Engine
    participant LLM as LLM Gateway (EU)
    participant Mon as Regulatory Monitor
    participant Rev as Reviewer (human)

    Firm->>API: Upload WSP PDF
    API->>Pipe: wsp.uploaded (outbox)
    Pipe->>Pipe: extract, section tree, hash, chunk, embed
    Pipe->>Eval: evaluation.run.requested
    Eval->>Eval: applicability filter + deterministic controls
    Eval->>LLM: semantic controls (hybrid retrieval evidence)
    LLM-->>Eval: structured JSON verdicts + citations
    Eval->>Eval: span check + groundedness gate
    Eval->>Rev: NEEDS_HUMAN_REVIEW subset
    Rev-->>Eval: confirmed / overridden
    Eval-->>API: findings with page+section evidence
    API-->>Firm: report + alerts (critical gaps)
    Firm->>API: remediation plan / new WSP version

    Note over Mon: continuous, independent of uploads
    Mon->>Mon: poll EUR-Lex / ESMA / EBA, diff eIds
    Mon->>Rev: ChangeSet + impact proposal
    Rev-->>Mon: approve control_version / mark invalidates
    Mon->>Eval: revalidation.fanout.requested
    Eval->>Eval: blast radius via dependency index, hash reuse
    Eval->>LLM: Batch API residue only
    LLM-->>Eval: verdicts
    Eval->>Eval: diff vs previous run
    Eval-->>Firm: alert only on NEW_GAP / WORSENED
